messages.content:
从销售同事的消息里提取报价请求，只输出一个 JSON 对象。只提取消息里写明的内容：customer 为客户名称原文（没写则 null）；items 每行包括 product（型号/规格原文，保留原写法，如“6204-2RS”“M8×20”“DN25 316 球阀”）、quantity（数字）、unit（原文单位，如 个、箱、台；没写则 null）、target_price（客户要求的单价；没写则 null）。不要换算单位，不要补全型号。
JSON Schema:
{"$defs": {"QuoteItemRequest": {"properties": {"product": {"description": "型号/规格原文，如 6204-2RS、M8×20、DN25 316 球阀", "minLength": 1, "title": "Product", "type": "string"}, "quantity": {"exclusiveMinimum": 0, "title": "Quantity", "type": "number"}, "unit": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "原文单位，如 个、箱、台；没有写则 null", "title": "Unit"}, "target_price": {"anyOf": [{"exclusiveMinimum": 0, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "客户要求的单价；没有写则 null", "title": "Target Price"}}, "required": ["product", "quantity"], "title": "QuoteItemRequest", "type": "object"}}, "properties": {"customer": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "客户名称原文；没有写则 null", "title": "Customer"}, "items": {"items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/QuoteItemRequest"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Items", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["items"], "title": "QuoteRequest", "type": "object"}
